// Jump offsets are 16 bits, stored as two bytes. To exercise the high byte,
// these jumps cross more than 255 bytes of code: each "print nil;" below is
// 2 bytes of bytecode (OP_NIL, OP_PRINT), and there are 150 of them = 300 bytes.

